    {
      "topic": "Original apphost06 failure",
      "conclusion": "Harness-only insufficient prerequisite assumption",
      "evidence": "Raw public Settings list at xcodebuild.log5086-5087 already has unique hittable English primary + real Arabic cell + AddLanguage in that order, no picker/search/keyboard/alert. V8 incorrectly requires Arabic absent. Independent apphost06 dossier retained; no app crash/regression inferred."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Already-satisfied path",
      "conclusion": "Strong observable precondition retained/strengthened, no forced language changes",
      "evidence": "396line Swift helper now classifies only current uncovered/hittable/finite in-viewport ordered preferred rows. English representation counts0..1 and at leastone, unique real Arabic cell, title/search/keyboard/alert guards required. Fresh second metadata read revalidates; final receipt already-satisfied plus arabicAddedByThisPrerequisite=false. Branch returns before Add/search/primary actions; original per-app matrix continues."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Missing-Arabic path",
      "conclusion": "Existing public action path preserved",
      "evidence": "Requires same current exposed English-primary list and zero Arabic cell/text counts. V8 AddLanguage/search/select/KeepEnglish path byte-identical except final var+disposition fields. Actual V8 addition parser still required by v9 when added; English+Arabic final viewport/ordering proof strengthened."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Receipt validity",
      "conclusion": "No synthetic prerequisite receipt can replace original native outcome",
      "evidence": "V9 requires one24case Swift decision contract plus exact ownership/status/cardinality/stage/sequence/activation guards. Unknown/BLOCKED rows fail. Already-satisfied cannot contain language mutationstages; addition must retain fullsteps. Runner requires exact five actual XCTest results before V9 proof and unchanged four scenario/ownership/local-game/OS probe afterward."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Tests and counterevidence",
      "conclusion": "18 new discoverable tests meaningfully exercise parser/source invariants; not yet run",
      "evidence": "True-flag-only proof, coveredpicker, wrongprimary, duplicatecells, missing/offscreen/NaNframes, wrongorder, absent/repeatednavigation, falseaddedclaim, missingSwiftcontract, incorrectownership and diagnosticsbudget negativefixtures reviewed. Sourcecontracts assert whole662matrix/probes/Start/finalizer unchanged; source hashes cover every consumed V8/V7/V6 reference. XCTAssert statements can print a contract despite failure, but mandatory exactXCTest pass prevents false-green overall."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Architecture and privacy",
      "conclusion": "No production change or new preference shortcut",
      "evidence": "Only isolatedcopied XCTest/receiptcontrols changed. No direct platformpreferencewrite, UIroute bypass, reducer/session/substitution, navigation migration, userprofile mutation, privateOSURL, physicalLAN or Storeoperation. ExistingownedfreshDebugsimulator barriers and failurefinalizers unchanged."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Uncertain OS behavior",
      "conclusion": "Still an experiment; no guarantee that multilingual list reveals per-app selector",
      "evidence": "Authoritative Apple references in reviews/independent-os-prerequisite-research-01.json establish public multilingual/per-app flow, not specificiOS26.5 selectors. Current helper blocks unknown state. Original per-app probe remains required and may still block."
